#. +> trunk5 stable5
#: midebuggerplugin.cpp:112
#, kde-format
#| msgid ""
#| "<b>Examine core file</b>"
#| "<p>This loads a core file, which is typically created after the application has crashed, e.g. with a segmentation fault. The core file contains an image of the program memory at the time it crashed, allowing you to do a post-mortem analysis.</p>"
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"<b>Examine core file</b>"
"<p>This loads a core file, which is typically created after the application has crashed, e.g. with a segmentation fault. The core file contains an image of the program memory at the time it crashed, allowing you to do a post-mortem analysis.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Examinar un ficheiro core</b>"
"<p>Isto carga un ficheiro core, que adoita crearse tras quebrar a aplicación, p. ex. cun fallo de segmentación. O ficheiro core contén unha imaxe da memoria do programa no momento que quebrou, permitíndolle facer unha análise post-mortem.</p>"

